[00:00.0000]作词 : Selena Gomez/Marshmello/Andrew Wotman/Louis Bell/Brian D. Lee/Alexandra Tamposi/Carl Rosen
[00:01.0000]作曲 : Selena Gomez/Marshmello/Andrew Wotman/Louis Bell/Brian D. Lee/Alexandra Tamposi/Carl Rosen
[00:09.1300]In your eyes, there's a heavy blue (在你的眼眸中，那充满了忧郁)
[00:12.6100]One to love, and one to lose (左眼蕴藏爱意 右眼闪烁黯然)
[00:16.3400]Sweet divine, a heavy truth (于甜蜜中却预感到事实的沉重)
[00:20.0300]Water or wine, don't make me choose (水还是酒,别把我逼到两难的境地)
[00:23.4400]
[00:23.5900]I wanna feel the way that we did that summer night, night (我只想重温我们曾一起共度的仲夏之夜)
[00:30.7900]Drunk on a feeling, alone with the stars in the sky (独自在醉意朦胧间仰望繁星点点)
[00:36.2100]
[00:38.0000]I've been running through the jungle (我在丛林中不断奔跑)
[00:40.0200]I've been running with the wolves (我和狼群一同前行)
[00:41.9400]To get to you, to get to you (只为追寻你 前往你身旁)
[00:45.7400]I've been down the darkest alleys (我一路沿着墨色浓重的小径前行)
[00:47.6700]Saw the dark side of the moon (甚至都看到了月球的背面)
[00:49.3900]To get to you, to get to you (只为追寻你 前往你身旁)
[00:53.3100]I've looked for love in every stranger (我在每个过客的心中搜索爱的踪迹)
[00:55.4500]Took too much to ease the anger (喝下太多的酒才稍稍缓解心头之愤)
[00:57.2400]All for you, yeah, all for you (都是为了你 都是因为你)
[01:01.0400]I've been running through the jungle (我在丛林中不断奔跑)
